  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Chunkout. Slappin' Bitches. NES Virus Cleaner. Ultimate Frogger Champion. Four of the best games made for the Nintendo Entertainment System in the last 5 years. Throw the four of them in a blender, while adding in some extras, and what do you get? One of the best and most challenging competition cartridges ever created! Racing against a time of 6 minutes and 21 seconds (adjustable), fly through the games as quickly as you can, while trying to maximizing your point totals at the same time! Do you have what it takes to poop on your friends' heads? To defend your base from an onslaught of enemies? To clear an entire screen in Chunkout, knowing every second you stop to think is a second wasted?? Can you save your NES from Viruses? Ready to play Ultimate Frogger Champion as quickly as possible with whatever time is left over, to get the highest score possible? Molding itself off of the 1990 Nintendo World Championship cartridge, the Homebrew World Championship 2012 cartridge is five games of fun, packed into one finely crafted product. The world needs a champion. Your challenge awaits!"
    }
  ],
